      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive caretakers and reliable shuttle team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise Ally and the daycare team at Soulmutts for their friendliness, warmth, and reliable care. Pet owners highlight the dependable shuttle drivers who make daily transportation seamless for busy city schedules. While a dissatisfied client reported indifferent supervision during a long stay, the overwhelming majority describe staff as dedicated and loving."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Energetic socialization and pack play"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners emphasize that their pets return home thoroughly exercised, content, and happily exhausted after daycare and boarding stays. Reviewers appreciate the socialization provided for diverse breeds, from high-energy pointers to retired racing greyhounds. Although one reviewer raised concerns regarding playgroup dynamics, pet parents broadly celebrate the joyful environment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious facility with clean playrooms"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors highlight the well-maintained, clean, and organized boarding facility in downtown Toronto. Reviewers appreciate the open play zones and comfortable resting areas that put pet parents at ease during drop-offs. While a reviewer touring the building expressed disappointment regarding unstaffed overnight hours, clients consistently praise the facility's hygiene and safety."
      }
    }
  ],
